#10400
bright light polva~
the bright polva~
A polva made out of pure light is glowing here.~
The bright white light from this polva hurts your eyes.~
ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_WEAK
0
500 S
30 0 0 10d40+800 5d5+10
10000 106194
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_NEUTRAL
>act_prog 100 p looks at you.~
if ispc($n)
  mpechoat $n The blinding light forces you to blink your eyes many times.
  mpechoaround $n $n blinks several times, and looks a little disoriented.
endif
~
>act_prog 100 p pokes you in the ribs.~
if ispc($n)
  mpechoat $n You are suprised when you find out that your finger goes right through its ribs  
  mpechoat $n In fact, you realize that there is no substance to the polva at all!
  mpechoaround $n $n stumbles forward through the polva, and you see a slight shimmer in the polva's aura.
endif
~
|
#10401
crystal polva~
the crystal polva~
A crystal polva is out trying to keep the palace clean of vermin.~
Light dances furtively in the many facets of the polva's crystaline skin.~
ACT_STAY_AREA|ACT_WEAK
AFF_PASS_DOOR|AFF_CLEAR
200 S
20 0 0 20d20+200 1d10+15
0 20422
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_NEUTRAL
>death_prog 100~
mpecho The crystal polva is shatters!
~
>hitprcnt_prog 20~
mpecho The crystal polva has shattered into lots of little pieces!
~
>hitprcnt_prog 40~
if rand(10)
  if isfight($i)   
    mpecho The crystal polva is cracking very badly!
  endif
endif
~
>hitprcnt_prog 60~
if rand(10)
  if isfight($i)   
    mpecho The crystal polva starting to crack!
  endif
endif
~
>hitprcnt_prog 80~
if rand(10)
  if isfight($i)   
    mpecho The crystal polva is beginning to show signs of weakness... 
  endif
endif
~
>hitprcnt_prog 100~
if rand(10)
  if isfight($i)   
    mpecho The crystal polva looks barely touched!
  endif
endif
~
>rand_prog 5~
mpecho The room changes into a rainbow of color, then back to blue again.
~
>rand_prog 100~
if inroom($i) == 10499
  cast heal
  if hitprcnt($i) == 1
    mpecho The crystal polva imploads!
    mptransfer $i 10404
    mpecho A crystal polva has arrived, looking more refreshed than the others.
  endif
endif
~
|
