10 0 0 10d10+80 1d10+9
3737 1934
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_NEUTRAL
#10403
polvo lord~
Lord Polvo~
Lord Polvo is sitting on his throne, avidly watching the 
jousting match in his large crystal ball.~
Lord Polvo, the legendary Lord of Light doesn't look quite so legendary
here.  He is still in excellent shape, and has lots of power about him,
but he just doesn't look like he could tear himself away from his 
crystal ball long enough to fight.~
ACT_SENTINEL
AFF_DETECT_INVIS|AFF_DETECT_HIDDEN|AFF_SANCTUARY
1000 S
35 0 0 10d10+1000 10d4+0
32331 144081
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
>speech_prog key ward demon demons~
if ispc($n)
  emote gasps!
  mpecho Lord polvo says 'I forgot all about the ward room!!'
  mpechoat $n Lord Polvo whispers in your ear 'go check it for me, please'
  if hasobjvnum(10400) 
  else
    oload 10400
  endif
  give shard $n
  emote relaxes, and continues to watch his favorite sport.
else
endif
~
>rand_prog 10~
emote cheers for the knight in red!
~
>rand_prog 20~
emote utters an incantation, and the black knight falls off of his horse.
~
>rand_prog 30~
emote laughs at the puny attempts of the black knight to best his red knight.
~
>rand_prog 40~
emote shines a light into the crystal ball, blinding the black knight.
~
>death_prog 100~
if actorhasobjnum(30900)
or actorhasobjnum(30966)
or actorhasobjnum(30967)
or actorhasobjnum(30968)
or actorhasobjnum(30969)
  if quest(30,1,$n) == 0
    mpmset $n quest 30 1 1
    mpoload 30914
    mpforce $n HELP GUILDTOKEN
    mpquiet on
    c 'giant strength' $n
    give i30914 $n
    mpquiet off
  endif
endif~
|
#10404
breeze~
the breeze~
A cool breeze flutters forth, dusting the ceiling as it goes.~
Even with detect invisible, you can't actually see the breeze, but you 
can certainly feel it...It feels VERY refreshing.~
ACT_SCAVENGER|ACT_STAY_AREA|ACT_WIMPY
AFF_INVISIBLE|AFF_DETECT_INVIS|AFF_DETECT_HIDDEN|AFF_CLEAR
200 S
10 0 0 1d1+351 1d9+9
0 1934
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_NEUTRAL
>rand_prog 30~
if rand(50)
  mpecho A whirling breeze brushes the dirt off of the ceiling.
else
  if isnpc($r)   
    mpechoaround $r A breeze flows through $r, producing a trail of dust.
  else
    if ispc($r)   
      mpechoat $r You feel a whirl of wind lift the dirt off of you.
      mpechoaround $r A breeze flows through $r, producing a trail of dust.
      mpechoaround $r You never knew how dirty $r was!
    else
    endif
  endif
endif
~
|
