#10409
siddern~
Siddern~
Siddern is here, mourning the loss of Pikon.~
Siddern an old man, with little life left in him.~
ACT_SENTINEL
AFF_SANCTUARY
300 S
30 0 0 10d10+600 5d9+9
0 106194
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
>all_greet_prog 100~
if actorhasobjnum(10405)
  mpechoat $n Your crystal bird starts to rock uncontrollably!    
  mpechoat $n You can hold on to the crystal bird no longer!
  mpforce $n drop $c
  mppurge $c
  mpmload 10410
  mpecho The crystal bird has taken flight!
  gasp 
  mpecho $i exclaims 'Pikon, you have returned!'
  mpecho Pikon, the crystal bird, flies too Siddern and perches on his shoulder.
  say Thank you for returning Pikon to me. 
  say Follow him, and he will lead you to a secret place.
else
  mpechoat $n Have you seen Pikon anywhere?
endif
~
>act_prog gets out of~
if actorhasobjnum(10405)
  mpechoat $n Your crystal bird starts to rock uncontrollably!    
  mpechoat $n You can hold on to the crystal bird no longer!
  mpforce $n drop $c
  mppurge $c
  mpmload 10410
  mpecho The crystal bird has taken flight!
  gasp 
  mpecho $i exclaims 'Pikon, you have returned!'
  mpecho Pikon, the crystal bird, flies too Siddern and perches on his shoulder.
  say For your goodness, follow Pikon, and he will show you a secret!
else
endif
~
>speech_prog pikon~
if inroom(pikon) != 10465
  mpechoaround $n $i tells $n all about Pikon.
  mpechoat $n $i tells you about Pikon.  'Pikon is..or was..my pet bird.  
  mpechoat $n He was a special bird though..  he was made out of living 
  mpechoat $n crystal, and he was given to me by Lord Polvo himself!  
  mpechoat $n Please, if you ever find him, let him know I am still here?'
  mpecho Siddern says 'I haven't seen Pikon for months!'
  mpecho $i sheds a tear.  
endif
~
|
